# `*.local` above already covers `.env.local`, which is the file the shadcn CLI reads
# for registry auth (`${TWENTYFIRST_API_KEY}` in components.json). A plain `.env` was
# matched by nothing — one typo away from committing a token.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
